{"id":"1a7c117bc54a8d10","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-parallel-substitution.md","title":"平行步的替换相容性","display":"lem-parallel-substitution — 平行步的替换相容性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-parallel-substitution","aliases":["56-lem-parallel-substitution"],"display":"lem-parallel-substitution — 平行步的替换相容性","depends_on":["[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"source_section":"§4.7 Lemma 4.7.6","source_printed_pages":"121","source_ocr_blocks":[142],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-parallel-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-parallel-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-parallel-substitution — 平行步的替换相容性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.7 Lemma 4.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"121"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_R\">\\(\\Rightarrow_R\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a> 的有限位置平行步。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>；替换应用和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R s\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R s\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的有限项树归纳。变量分支正是前提。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\">\\(s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\)</span>，把各归纳所得平行步的见证位置前接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i)\">\\((i)\\)</span>；不同儿子的这些位置两两不交，所有替换后的子项同时组成目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(s_1\\tau,\\ldots,s_n\\tau)\">\\(f(s_1\\tau,\\ldots,s_n\\tau)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时取空位置集，得到常元恒等平行步。不要求正交性，也不要求右线性：变量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 中重复时，在每个互不交的出现处复制同一平行步即可。</p>\n<p>本目录采用位置定义；它等价于原书的变量恒等、根规则收缩、按函数儿子组合三种构造。反向分解：含根位置的平行步只有该位置；不含根的位置集按首索引分组。正向把子步位置前接首索引。这同时解释后续归纳证明为何可用于当前接口。原书 OCR 的函数子句呈 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，而自反性证明需要零元函数；此处空见证显式覆盖常元。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em> (2003), Lemma 4.7.6；已读并逐项重建结构归纳证明。页块号来自本地 DjVu 文字层，不表示已核对的物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 为 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]] 的有限位置平行步。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$，$s\\in T$；替换应用和 $\\operatorname{Var}(s)$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$，$s\\in T$；替换应用和 $\\operatorname{Var}(s)$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R s\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)","display":false},{"tex":"(i)","display":false},{"tex":"f(s_1\\tau,\\ldots,s_n\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false}],"bytes":2162,"backlinks":[{"id":"cdd1f74aa0c940f7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,t,w\\in T$；平行替换相容性与真左部模式保持分别见 [[56-lem-parallel-substitution]]、[[56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-parallel-substitution.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1f468692d9334725","6aa7f56f36c897f4","491e726b9c1f42b0"]}